#. type: delimited block .
#: ../Documentation-sedout/howto/coordinate-embargoed-releases.txt:229
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Git project released new versions on <date>, addressing <CVE>.\n"
msgstr "The Git project released new versions on <date>, addressing <CVE>.\n"

#. type: delimited block .
